DreamUIInputSubsystem:InteractionHosts {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamUIInputSubsystem.h#DreamUIInputSubsystem:InteractionHosts
    src   "One transient actor per local player, carrying whichever raycasters were created for them.\n\nPer PLAYER rather than per kind, so a player pointing at both a screen UI and a world-space panel has one\nhost with two raycasters on it instead of two actors that mean the same thing."
    text  "每个本地玩家一个瞬态 Actor，承载为其创建的任何射线投射器。\n\n按玩家而非按类型划分，因此同时指向屏幕 UI 和世界空间面板的玩家只有一个\n宿主，上面带有两个射线投射器，而不是两个含义相同的 Actor。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIInputTickFunction {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Event/DreamUIInputSubsystem.h#DreamUIInputTickFunction
    src   "The world's input frame: every player's pipeline, once per frame, in player order.\n\nTG_PostPhysics, and ticking while the game is paused: after every player controller has run its input in\nTG_PrePhysics -- so a click queued there is dispatched in the same frame, whatever order the actors happen to\ntick in -- and before the UI manager lays out and draws, which the engine runs after the tick groups. The event\nsystem components used to tick in TG_PrePhysics beside the controllers, with no order declared between them: a\nclick went out this frame or the next depending on which ticked first."
    text  "世界的输入帧：每个玩家的处理管线，每帧执行一次，按玩家顺序执行。\n\n在 TG_PostPhysics 中执行，且游戏暂停时也会 tick：在每个玩家控制器于\nTG_PrePhysics 中运行完输入之后——因此在那里排队的点击会在同一帧内派发，无论各 Actor 恰好以什么顺序\ntick——并且在 UI 管理器进行布局和绘制之前，而引擎是在 tick 组之后才运行这些。事件\n系统组件过去与控制器一起在 TG_PrePhysics 中 tick，两者之间未声明顺序：点击\n是在这一帧还是下一帧发出，取决于谁先 tick。"
    state machine
}
